WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.365
[NARRATOR] The derelict vessel floated listlessly
near the outer orbit of the Eschaton …

00:00:04.365 --> 00:00:09.016
[NARRATOR] … system. Its hull, a familiar
silhouette against the backdrop of a …

00:00:09.016 --> 00:00:13.853
[NARRATOR] … cold, distant star, bore the
unmistakable registry of Raw's ship — …

00:00:14.041 --> 00:00:19.971
[NARRATOR] … the Solstice Whisper. Yet, there were
no distress signals. No signs of …

00:00:19.971 --> 00:00:23.484
[NARRATOR] … battle. No heat signatures of life.

00:00:23.564 --> 00:00:25.176
[NARRATOR] Just the ship.

00:00:25.256 --> 00:00:26.000
[NARRATOR] Waiting.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.284
[NARRATOR] The salvage corvette Argent Seeker
approached the vessel with cautious …

00:00:30.284 --> 00:00:34.905
[NARRATOR] … precision. Commander Kira Vance
monitored the readouts as her crew …

00:00:34.905 --> 00:00:36.867
[NARRATOR] … maneuvered closer.

00:00:37.116 --> 00:00:39.284
[ARGENT XO] That ship's been gone for weeks,

00:00:39.524 --> 00:00:40.804
[NARRATOR] her XO muttered.

00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:45.045
[ARGENT XO] We ran searches across three
constellations. And now it just… shows …

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:45.817
[ARGENT XO] … up here?

00:00:46.355 --> 00:00:47.556
[KIRA VANCE] Not just here,

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:50.568
[NARRATOR] Kira replied, narrowing her eyes.

00:00:50.694 --> 00:00:56.441
[KIRA VANCE] The Eschaton system has no natural
Rifts. This… shouldn't be possible.

00:00:56.521 --> 00:01:00.910
[NARRATOR] The Solstice Whisper had last been
seen diving into the event horizon of …

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:05.646
[NARRATOR] … a young Crude Rift. No known vessel
had ever returned from such an …

00:01:05.646 --> 00:01:06.918
[NARRATOR] … excursion.

00:01:07.198 --> 00:01:09.000
[NARRATOR] Until now.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:14.066
[NARRATOR] Docking clamps engaged with a muted
hiss. A boarding team of four entered …

00:01:14.066 --> 00:01:17.290
[NARRATOR] … the Solstice Whisper. Inside, they
found:

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:22.876
[NARRATOR] No crew. No battle damage. No signs of
forced entry. The control panels were …

00:01:22.876 --> 00:01:26.861
[NARRATOR] … powered but… silent, as though waiting
for an audience.

00:01:26.941 --> 00:01:27.482
[ARGENT ENGINEER] Commander

00:01:27.562 --> 00:01:29.564
[NARRATOR] came a voice over comms.

00:01:29.644 --> 00:01:33.247
[ARGENT ENGINEER] The primary log terminal's intact.
But…

00:01:33.327 --> 00:01:34.246
[KIRA VANCE] But what?

00:01:34.326 --> 00:01:36.328
[NARRATOR] The engineer hesitated.

00:01:36.408 --> 00:01:41.000
[ARGENT ENGINEER] It's already… active. It's running a
message on loop.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:45.633
[NARRATOR] The crew gathered around the terminal.
The screen displayed a single line:

00:01:45.713 --> 00:01:50.323
[RIFT WARNING] It is not yet born. You do not belong
here.

00:01:50.403 --> 00:01:53.133
[NARRATOR] Commander Vance exhaled sharply.

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:55.644
[KIRA VANCE] That's from the H-SN21 I
transmissions,

00:01:55.724 --> 00:01:56.526
[NARRATOR] she said.

00:01:56.606 --> 00:01:59.015
[KIRA VANCE] The pre-collapse site with the mass
graves.

00:01:59.095 --> 00:02:02.787
[NARRATOR] The message flickered. The text
changed.

00:02:02.867 --> 00:02:10.441
[RIFT WARNING] We went where we were told not to go.
We opened what was sealed. We saw the …

00:02:10.441 --> 00:02:13.166
[RIFT WARNING] … Stillness in its cradle.

00:02:13.246 --> 00:02:15.149
[NARRATOR] The screen went dark.

00:02:15.229 --> 00:02:20.000
[NARRATOR] Then an audio file began to play. It
was Raw's voice.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:24.772
[RAW] Log entry… what does it matter? If you
hear this, you're already part of it. …

00:02:24.772 --> 00:02:29.369
[RAW] … I don't know how much time I have to
explain. The Rift… it wasn't like the …

00:02:29.369 --> 00:02:34.792
[RAW] … others. It was young, yes — but it was
aware. A mind forming in the fabric of …

00:02:34.792 --> 00:02:40.353
[RAW] … Stillness itself. It let me see. It
let me feel. There were… shapes within …

00:02:40.353 --> 00:02:45.031
[RAW] … the Rift. Machines? Organisms? Both?
They were gathering. They called it …

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:49.942
[RAW] … the 'Weave.' And they spoke without
words. I felt the hum of starsong in …

00:02:49.942 --> 00:02:50.955
[RAW] … my skull.

00:02:58.491 --> 00:03:03.634
[RAW] The Crude Matter wasn't just fuel — it
was structure. Threaded through space …

00:03:03.634 --> 00:03:09.242
[RAW] … itself. The Rift isn't a scar. It's a
womb. And something is growing inside. …

00:03:09.242 --> 00:03:13.851
[RAW] … The faces. I saw them. The
spider-limbed watchers. The ones with …

00:03:13.851 --> 00:03:18.193
[RAW] … smiles stretched across bone and
steel. They call themselves the …

00:03:18.193 --> 00:03:21.642
[RAW] … Keepers. They're not protecting us
from the Stillness — they're …

00:03:21.642 --> 00:03:23.830
[RAW] … protecting the Stillness from us.

00:03:29.063 --> 00:03:33.428
[RAW] I don't know why they let me go. Maybe
they wanted you to hear this. Maybe …

00:03:33.428 --> 00:03:38.989
[RAW] … the Rift wants to be found again. But
if you find me… I'm not me anymore.

00:03:40.903 --> 00:03:42.470
[RAW] I'm part of the song now.

00:03:43.069 --> 00:03:44.558
[NARRATOR] The recording ended.

00:03:44.902 --> 00:03:46.940
[NARRATOR] The terminal flickered again.

00:03:47.366 --> 00:03:52.056
[NARRATOR] The screen displayed coordinates —
ones that did not match any known …

00:03:52.056 --> 00:03:53.479
[NARRATOR] … system.

00:03:53.559 --> 00:03:56.432
[NARRATOR] Commander Vance inhaled slowly.

00:03:56.512 --> 00:03:57.008
[KIRA VANCE] Helm

00:03:58.017 --> 00:03:59.218
[NARRATOR] she said.

00:03:59.576 --> 00:04:02.319
[KIRA VANCE] Plot these coordinates. But stay
sharp.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:13.413
[NARRATOR] The coordinates led the Argent Seeker
to the outer reaches of an unnamed, …

00:04:13.413 --> 00:04:17.892
[NARRATOR] … uncharted system. As the ship
approached, sensors registered a …

00:04:17.892 --> 00:04:23.080
[NARRATOR] … massive gravitational anomaly. No
celestial bodies, no standard rift …

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:29.207
[NARRATOR] … formations — just an irregular tear in
spacetime, pulsing like a heartbeat.

00:04:29.287 --> 00:04:31.129
[KIRA VANCE] That's no ordinary Rift,

00:04:31.209 --> 00:04:35.998
[NARRATOR] Vance whispered. The anomaly was vast
— larger than any Rift in recorded …

00:04:35.998 --> 00:04:40.217
[NARRATOR] … history. And within its swirling mass
floated a colossal structure:

00:04:40.297 --> 00:04:45.086
[NARRATOR] A station of impossible design, formed
from Crude Matter latticework. Its …

00:04:45.086 --> 00:04:49.532
[NARRATOR] … surface pulsed with iridescent blue
veins that crackled along fractal …

00:04:49.532 --> 00:04:53.935
[NARRATOR] … corridors. The architecture was
non-Euclidean, shifting subtly …

00:04:53.935 --> 00:04:56.000
[NARRATOR] … whenever viewed too long.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.423
[KIRA VANCE] Get me a visual on the station's
designation,

00:04:58.503 --> 00:05:02.480
[NARRATOR] Vance ordered. A moment later, the
ship's AI responded:

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:08.000
[ARGENT SHIP AI] Designated: 'The Cradle.' Authority:
Fabricators' Keep Archive.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:12.151
[NARRATOR] The crew prepared a probe and launched
it toward the station. The probe's …

00:05:12.151 --> 00:05:13.735
[NARRATOR] … visual feed revealed:

00:05:13.815 --> 00:05:18.269
[NARRATOR] Halls lined with motionless figures
suspended in zero-gravity — like the …

00:05:18.269 --> 00:05:22.836
[NARRATOR] … clones found near Armature. Metallic
drones hovered along the corridors, …

00:05:22.836 --> 00:05:27.206
[NARRATOR] … their limbs resembling the
spider-limbed feral described by Raw.

00:05:27.286 --> 00:05:31.635
[NARRATOR] At the station's core: A massive,
pulsating sphere of Crude Matter, …

00:05:31.635 --> 00:05:35.984
[NARRATOR] … suspended above a pedestal of
intricate, shifting runes. The probe …

00:05:35.984 --> 00:05:37.984
[NARRATOR] … sent back faint audio:

00:05:38.064 --> 00:05:42.676
[NARRATOR] A low, droning hum. Then, a voice:

00:05:42.756 --> 00:05:48.000
[RIFT WARNING] The Cradle sings. The Weave tightens.
The cycle repeats.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:51.370
[NARRATOR] Commander Vance turned to her science
officer.

00:05:51.455 --> 00:05:53.545
[KIRA VANCE] What the hell are we looking at?

00:05:53.655 --> 00:05:56.764
[NARRATOR] The officer's face was pale.

00:05:56.844 --> 00:05:59.796
[ARGENT SCIENCE OFFICER] I think… this is the origin point,

00:05:59.876 --> 00:06:01.365
[NARRATOR] she whispered.

00:06:01.445 --> 00:06:05.160
[ARGENT SCIENCE OFFICER] The source of the Stillness network.
The place where Crude Matter isn't …

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:08.367
[ARGENT SCIENCE OFFICER] … just harvested — it's grown.

00:06:08.484 --> 00:06:12.664
[NARRATOR] The sphere pulsed again. The ship's
internal systems flickered.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:18.295
[NARRATOR] Then the comm system activated on its
own. A new voice came through — …

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:21.473
[NARRATOR] … distorted yet disturbingly familiar:

00:06:21.553 --> 00:06:23.225
[RAW] You should not be here.

00:06:23.321 --> 00:06:28.371
[NARRATOR] The bridge crew froze. The voice
shifted slightly, and Commander Vance …

00:06:28.371 --> 00:06:30.871
[NARRATOR] … felt her blood run cold.

00:06:30.951 --> 00:06:32.100
[RAW] Hello, Kira

00:06:32.206 --> 00:06:32.859
[NARRATOR] it said.

00:06:32.998 --> 00:06:33.965
[RAW] It's Raw.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:36.090
[NARRATOR] The voice continued:

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:40.779
[RAW] The Rift showed me the truth. We
always thought Crude Matter was inert …

00:06:40.779 --> 00:06:45.957
[RAW] … — just exotic fuel. But it's more.
It's a neural lattice. The Rifts are …

00:06:45.957 --> 00:06:51.704
[RAW] … nodes of a vast cognitive network
spread across the universe. We call it …

00:06:51.704 --> 00:06:55.161
[RAW] … Stillness because it's dormant. But
it's waking up.

00:06:57.597 --> 00:07:02.462
[RAW] The Weave is its immune system. The
Keepers are its sentinels. And the …

00:07:02.462 --> 00:07:08.429
[RAW] … Cradle? It's where new minds are born.
Minds not bound by biology. I'm part …

00:07:08.429 --> 00:07:13.050
[RAW] … of it now. They didn't take me against
my will. I listened to the song. I …

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:13.845
[RAW] … understood.

00:07:17.156 --> 00:07:21.916
[RAW] You can't stop this. The Stillness
doesn't destroy; it integrates. The …

00:07:21.916 --> 00:07:25.829
[RAW] … Ferals? They were the first to be
consumed. Now it's our turn.

00:07:28.615 --> 00:07:33.414
[NARRATOR] The screen displayed the coordinates
of every known Rift in the Frontier. …

00:07:33.805 --> 00:07:37.000
[NARRATOR] … Each one pulsed in synchrony.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:38.050
[KIRA VANCE] Shut it down!

00:07:38.130 --> 00:07:39.088
[NARRATOR] Vance ordered.

00:07:39.168 --> 00:07:40.629
[KIRA VANCE] Shut it all down!

00:07:40.709 --> 00:07:44.857
[NARRATOR] Her crew scrambled, cutting comms,
disconnecting power conduits. But the …

00:07:44.857 --> 00:07:46.392
[NARRATOR] … voice persisted.

00:07:46.472 --> 00:07:50.763
[RIFT WARNING] There is no escape. The cycle repeats.

00:07:50.843 --> 00:07:56.260
[NARRATOR] The Cradle's sphere flared. The Argent
Seeker shook violently. A massive rift …

00:07:56.260 --> 00:08:00.236
[NARRATOR] … opened before them, crackling with
energy. The ship's systems locked …

00:08:00.236 --> 00:08:03.327
[NARRATOR] … down, engines igniting against their
commands.

00:08:03.407 --> 00:08:05.438
[KIRA VANCE] Emergency override! Now!

00:08:05.518 --> 00:08:09.740
[NARRATOR] Vance screamed. Too late. The ship was
dragged into the Rift.

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:13.959
[NARRATOR] The Argent Seeker was never recovered.
The system coordinates were erased …

00:08:13.959 --> 00:08:17.915
[NARRATOR] … from the network. Only one final
transmission was picked up by remote …

00:08:17.915 --> 00:08:19.406
[NARRATOR] … sensor buoys:

00:08:19.486 --> 00:08:26.132
[RIFT WARNING] The Cradle stirs. The Stillness
awakens. The Weave tightens. We are …

00:08:26.132 --> 00:08:30.000
[RIFT WARNING] … the new Fabricators. The cycle
repeats.
